\itemize{
\item (\eqn{x_{i,j}}) is the raw intensity for feature \eqn{i} in sample \eqn{j}
\item (\eqn{x'_{i,j}}) is the normalized intensity for feature \eqn{i} in
sample \eqn{j}
\item (\eqn{c}) is a cofactor that determines the degree of transformation
